abstract: >-
  Historical v0.2.0 research snapshot and ongoing evidence record for task-conditioned
  compositional simplification of learned neural computation, training-time consolidation,
  precision/repair studies, reproducibility, and bounded systems proof-of-concept work.
  The current repository is under pre-announcement hardening; the snapshot version does not
  certify broad external validity or production readiness.
keywords:
